Chain Heal Bonus
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to RESTORATION_ChainHeal 
    Actions
        -------- == ABILITY MODIFIER == --------
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempLevel = (Level of (Ability being cast) for (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet Ability_TempAmount = (Ability_ChainHeal_Base[Ability_TempLevel] + (1.50 x (Real((Intelligence of (Triggering unit) (Include bonuses))))))
        -------- ------------- --------
        Ability - Set Ability: (Unit: (Triggering unit)'s Ability with Ability Code: RESTORATION_ChainHeal )'s Real Level Field: Damage per Target ('Ocl1') of Level: ((Level of RESTORATION_ChainHeal  for (Triggering unit)) - 1) to Ability_TempAmount
        -------- If unit has Totemic Resurgence --------
        Trigger - Run Totemic Resurgence <gen> (checking conditions)
        Set VariableSet Temp_Integer = (Custom value of (Target unit of ability being cast))
        Set VariableSet chainheal_target[Temp_Integer] = (Target unit of ability being cast)
        Set VariableSet chainheal_point = (Position of chainheal_target[Temp_Integer])
        Set VariableSet ancestralward_temp = (Custom value of (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet chainheal_intelligence[ancestralward_temp] = (Intelligence of (Triggering unit) (Include bonuses))
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                TotemicResurgence_Real Greater than 0.00
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Create 1 DummyChainHeal for (Owner of chainheal_target[Temp_Integer]) at chainheal_point facing Default building facing degrees
                Set VariableSet chainheal_dummy = (Last created unit)
                Unit - Add a 0.50 second Generic expiration timer to chainheal_dummy
                -------- Check for bonus spell level --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        TotemicResurgence_Real Equal to 1.15
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Set level of RESTORATION_AncestralWard  for chainheal_dummy to 1
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        TotemicResurgence_Real Equal to 1.30
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Set level of RESTORATION_AncestralWard  for chainheal_dummy to 2
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        TotemicResurgence_Real Equal to 1.45
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Set level of RESTORATION_AncestralWard  for chainheal_dummy to 3
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        TotemicResurgence_Real Equal to 1.60
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Set level of RESTORATION_AncestralWard  for chainheal_dummy to 4
                    Else - Actions
                -------- Cast the bonus spell --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        TotemicResurgence_Real Greater than 0.00
                    Then - Actions
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: (debug chain heal - TotemicResurgence_Real =   + (String(TotemicResurgence_Real)))
                        Unit - Order chainheal_dummy to Human Priest - Inner Fire chainheal_target[Temp_Integer]
                    Else - Actions
            Else - Actions
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_chainheal_point)
